{
  "name": "Trance of Order",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to align your consciousness to the endless calculations of Mechanus. As a Bonus Action, you can enter this state for 1 minute. For the duration, Attack Rolls against you can't benefit from Advantage, and whenever you make an Attack Roll, an Ability Check, or a Saving Throw, you can treat a roll of 9 or lower on the d20 as a 10.</p><p>Once you use this Bonus Action, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest, unless you spend 5 sorcery points to use it again.</p>",
